WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.823
Two friends, one city,
forty minutes apart.

00:00:03.879 --> 00:00:06.087
So they text, and they never meet.

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:10.974
Halfway finds the fair spot.
Type two addresses.

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:17.673
We drop a pin where it takes you both
the same time, at a place worth the trip.

00:00:18.088 --> 00:00:22.503
Twenty minutes for her.
Twenty minutes for you.

00:00:22.808 --> 00:00:25.574
Last month, fourteen thousand
people met in the middle.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.974
Coffee. Lunch.
One first date that became a second.

00:00:30.671 --> 00:00:33.878
This year, five more cities,
and one more seat at the table.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.165
Halfway. Meet in the middle.
